G229 -- THE SHAPE-LOCK EMPIRICAL: gamma = (2+n)/n vs committed slopes
======================================================================================

(1) THE LOCK  gamma = (2+n)/n   <- the committed n values
      n=2.000 -> gamma =  2.000   (phantom class (G158 DE anchor / the MW curve's family))
